{"title": "Hoots' Hooch table", "pageid": 47147, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hoots'_Hooch_table", "categories": ["Attribute tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch\">Hoots' Hooch</a> will unleash one of the listed effects when drunk. Rolls on the table similarly to <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> effects.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hoots.27_Hooch_Effects\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hoots'_Hooch_Effects\">Hoots' Hooch Effects</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Hoots' Hooch table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Effect\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Duration\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 750px;\" scope=\"col\">Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Bad_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Bad Breath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bad Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Bad_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Bad Breath (Condition)\">Bad Breath</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Characters attacking you in melee become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nauseous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Nauseous_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nauseous_(Condition)\" title=\"Nauseous (Condition)\">Nauseous</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beast Tongue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Speak_with_Animals_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Beast_Tongue_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Beast Tongue (Condition)\">Beast Tongue</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">20\n</td>\n<td>You're pretty sure you could speak to animals if you tried. Grants <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a> checks against <a href=\"/wiki/Beast\" title=\"Beast\">Beasts</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blackout\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Unconscious_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Blackout_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Blackout (Condition)\">Blackout</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">5\n</td>\n<td>Character is unconscious.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blink_(Condition)\" title=\"Blink (Condition)\">Blink</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Blink between the material and ethereal plane in your drunken stupor.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dancing Fool\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\">Dancing Fool</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">2\n</td>\n<td>Begin an elaborate jig that stops you from taking movement and actions, gives you <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on attacks and Dexterity <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a>. Enemies have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on attacks against you while you boogie.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gifted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Gifted_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Gifted (Condition)\">Gifted</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">20\n</td>\n<td>You can read minds, but become <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerable\">Vulnerable</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Photosensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Photosensitivity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Photosensitivity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Photosensitivity_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Photosensitivity (Condition)\">Photosensitivity</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td>Become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blind</a> in direct sunlight but gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Darkvision\" title=\"Superior Darkvision\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/38px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/50px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Superior Darkvision\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp/25px-Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Superior_Darkvision_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Darkvision\" title=\"Superior Darkvision\">Superior Darkvision</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Size_Instability_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Size Instability (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Size Instability\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Size_Instability_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Size Instability (Condition)\">Size Instability</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">10\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reduced_(Condition)\" title=\"Reduced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reduce\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Reduced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reduced_(Condition)\" title=\"Reduced (Condition)\">Reduce</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enlarged_(Condition)\" title=\"Enlarged (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enlarge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Enlarged_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enlarged_(Condition)\" title=\"Enlarged (Condition)\">Enlarge</a> each turn.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Stoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Stoned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch:_Stoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch: Stoned (Condition)\">Stoned</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\">2\n</td>\n<td>Temporarily <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.we